<title>SPAIN: Santander Q1 results by business area.</title>
<headline>Santander Q1 results by business area.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are Banco Santander net profits by business area.</p>
<p>(In billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>				     Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p> Corp. activity losses	   2.14    vs    2.37</p>
<p> Retail banking		   30.38    vs   22.49</p>
<p>    Santander in Spain	  11.01    vs   10.86</p>
<p>    Banesto			  8.56    vs    7.32</p>
<p>    Retail banking abroad     10.82    vs    4.30</p>
<p> Wholesale banking		 8.14    vs    8.35</p>
<p>    Santander Investment	 3.61    vs    2.56</p>
<p>    Corp. Banking, Treasury,   4.53    vs    5.79</p>
<p>and Capital Markets</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
